# Generate the demo GIF:  brew install vhs  &&  vhs demo.tape   (outputs demo.gif)
Output demo.gif
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1100
Set Height 640
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Type "lifeboat doctor"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "lifeboat run 'add retry logic to the API client' --simulate rate_limited"
Enter
Sleep 6s
